 "title": "Passenger Claims Management For Airlines | justclaims.eu",
 "description": "Automate and simplify your claims handling process with justclaims.eu through the use of a digital and time-saving solution, reduce your cost by up to 50 per cent, \nenhance your passengers’ UX and increase ticket sales at the same time. ",
 "text": "Weiter zum Hauptinhalt\n\nWhy justclaims.eu\n\nAbout us\n\nResources\n\nRequest a Demo\nPassenger Claims\nManagement for Airlines\n\nFully digital, automated and time-saving claims handling process\n\nSee also our court case management solution\n\nOne platform - all your claims\n\nSave time and lower costs\n\nAutomate your processes\n\nRegain customer  loyalty \n\nImprove sustainability\n\nPowerful features \n\nIntuitive and simple way to  handle claims\n\nFull workflow automation\n\nTransparency and control via excellent analytics\n\nSee all features\nAbout us\n\n\njustclaims.eu was founded by a team of aviation attorneys in order to offer airline clients an easy and encompassing tool for their claims handling.\n\nSee the team\n\nBy implementing justclaims.eu we have the benefit of improving the customer experience by responding more quickly and efficiently to our passengers' claims.\n\nSidney Hansmeier\n\n Manager Customer Relations & Insights\n\nDiscover Airlines\n\nWe are proud to be recognized by some of the world’s leading news platforms and publications\nSee our demo and understand all the benefits.\n\nExperience a live demo tailored to you, get answers to your unique questions, and find out why justclaims.eu is the right choice for your organization. \n\nRequest a Demo\n\nCHS Claims Handling Solutions GmbH \n\nGüterplatz 1\n60327 Frankfurt am Main\n\n​\n\nT +49 69 380 299 910\nF +49 69 380 299 911\n\nImprint\n\nPrivacy Policy",
